Forever Frost Alert is an independent World of Warcraft addon.
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Blizzard Entertainment.

World of Warcraft and Blizzard game assets belong to their respective owners.
The in-game effect references the Frozen Fingers texture already present in
the player's game client (FileDataID 449489). No Blizzard artwork is bundled
with this addon. The MIT license does not grant rights to Blizzard game assets.

The project avatar in assets/branding/icon.png was generated specifically for
this project using OpenAI's image generation tool. It is project branding,
not an in-game screenshot or the artwork rendered by the addon.

Development references:
https://github.com/Gethe/wow-ui-source/tree/forever/Interface/AddOns/Blizzard_AuraContainer
https://github.com/ennvina/spellactivationoverlay/blob/main/textures/texname.lua
